<script setup>import {photos} from '../data.js'</script><template><section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">A little about us</span><h1>For the feeling<br/>behind the frame.</h1><p>Casil Shots is a photography and creative service for people, gatherings and ideas worth remembering.</p></section><section class="section about-band"><img :src="photos[7].image" alt="Casil Shots portrait sample"/><div><span class="eyebrow">The approach</span><h2>Unposed, considered, personal.</h2><p class="muted">We believe the strongest photographs begin with comfort and connection. Sessions are collaborative and relaxed, with gentle direction when you need it and room for the unexpected moments in between.</p><p class="muted">From the first conversation to your final gallery, the goal is simple: create images that feel like you.</p><RouterLink class="button" to="/contact">Plan a session</RouterLink></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2>A simple process.</h2></div></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">01  |  Connect</span><h3>Tell us your idea</h3><p>Share what you have in mind, who is involved and the feeling you want the photographs to hold.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">02  |  Create</span><h3>Be in the moment</h3><p>We plan the details together and make space for genuine expressions and easy-going direction.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">03  |  Keep</span><h3>Relive your story</h3><p>Your curated edited photographs are delivered in a simple online gallery.</p></article></div></section></template>
